00:11:46.100 --> 00:12:03.560
And here you have something, Cyrus, via Ezra Sofer, who proclaims that the Torah is the official law of the Jew.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:15.860
And now, the dream of Moshe Rabbeinu in Harsinai, paradoxically enough, is fulfilled by this guy Koresh, by Cyrus.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:26.620
By allowing the Jews, now we have a law, yes, which we could claim any place in the world, any place,

