00:49:22.140 --> 00:49:24.080
Number one, which is something extraordinary.

00:49:25.060 --> 00:49:30.320
Whenever he mixed military tactics with prayers.

00:49:30.320 --> 00:49:38.820
In other words, it was always before you go to the military to fight, they would pray and ask God for this and so on.

00:49:39.020 --> 00:49:48.000
So it was a combination, a combination of sword and tefillah.

00:49:48.940 --> 00:49:54.380
And apparently, here comes something which is difficult to understand from the military point of view.

00:49:54.380 --> 00:49:57.180
those people who have been just simple peasants

00:49:57.180 --> 00:49:58.480
that never studied warfare

00:49:58.480 --> 00:50:00.740
that you never had any military experience

00:50:00.740 --> 00:50:02.480
we had no military schools

00:50:02.480 --> 00:50:05.320
those people who combined

00:50:05.320 --> 00:50:07.160
believing God

00:50:07.160 --> 00:50:08.160
or faith in God

00:50:08.160 --> 00:50:10.500
religious fervor

00:50:10.500 --> 00:50:12.900
with common sword

00:50:12.900 --> 00:50:15.240
they became formidable

00:50:15.240 --> 00:50:16.400
great

00:50:16.400 --> 00:50:18.200
extraordinary soldiers

00:50:18.200 --> 00:50:20.980
that was one thing

00:50:20.980 --> 00:50:21.660
that he did

00:50:21.660 --> 00:50:23.720
you don't have to be

00:50:23.720 --> 00:50:26.060
a military genius.

00:50:26.440 --> 00:50:27.140
The other person

00:50:27.140 --> 00:50:28.540
that spent 30, 40 years,

00:50:28.600 --> 00:50:28.920
I don't know,

00:50:29.200 --> 00:50:30.100
training for military,

00:50:30.500 --> 00:50:31.820
you are just a simple peasant,

00:50:32.220 --> 00:50:34.160
you take the sword

00:50:34.160 --> 00:50:35.420
and you have a muna

00:50:35.420 --> 00:50:36.460
and you fight

00:50:36.460 --> 00:50:37.520
and you could defeat it.

00:50:37.600 --> 00:50:38.280
That's what it was like.

00:50:38.440 --> 00:50:39.160
That was the whole notion

00:50:39.160 --> 00:50:40.800
of the head of Pifiot,

00:50:41.720 --> 00:50:42.220
Be'adam.

00:50:42.800 --> 00:50:43.860
They had a sword

00:50:43.860 --> 00:50:44.920
with a head mouth,

00:50:45.040 --> 00:50:46.440
the sword like a spoke

00:50:46.440 --> 00:50:48.620
and the sword in a sense

00:50:48.620 --> 00:50:49.480
was becoming like

00:50:49.480 --> 00:50:50.760
a holy instrument

00:50:50.760 --> 00:50:52.880
by which they fought

00:50:52.880 --> 00:50:53.600
and defended themselves.

00:50:53.720 --> 00:50:54.880
That's one thing.

00:50:55.380 --> 00:50:56.840
Second thing, which is very, very important.

00:50:58.360 --> 00:51:03.740
He attacked the army where it hurt most.

00:51:04.020 --> 00:51:05.000
How did he attack the army?

00:51:05.620 --> 00:51:11.340
He would cut the roads and the bridges,

00:51:12.380 --> 00:51:15.480
impeding them from collecting taxes.

00:51:16.260 --> 00:51:18.880
In other words, he would attack,

00:51:19.460 --> 00:51:21.600
not an army who is just an army there,

00:51:21.600 --> 00:51:25.200
but the army when it's going to collect taxes or to bring the taxes.

00:51:25.620 --> 00:51:28.500
So all of a sudden, not only was killing people,

00:51:28.800 --> 00:51:30.260
but was hurting their pocket.

00:51:31.560 --> 00:51:32.020
All right?

00:51:33.120 --> 00:51:34.780
And last but not least,

00:51:35.680 --> 00:51:38.040
he promulgated a new kind of law.

00:51:38.720 --> 00:51:39.480
Let me tell you something.

00:51:39.780 --> 00:51:40.440
It's incredible.

