We fought for it during that period.

00:58:44.340 --> 00:58:50.700
Now, it was a very fierce war.

00:58:51.260 --> 00:58:54.000
It lasted about three years.

00:58:55.060 --> 00:58:59.560
And one of the things that they did, eventually Matatja died.

00:58:59.880 --> 00:59:07.820
And he passes the leadership to his son Yehuda, the famous Judah the Maccabee.

00:59:07.820 --> 00:59:25.540
And to make the story short, in the 25th month of Kislev, three years after, they suddenly, they attack Yerushalayim, which was in the hands of traitor Jews.

00:59:25.540 --> 00:59:44.380
Jews who, you know, traitor Jews, and the Greeks, they fall upon Jerusalem, they take it over, and they establish their own kingdom, and the 25th of Kislev becomes a day of celebration.

00:59:44.380 --> 00:59:51.380
One of the things that they did, and I want to show you how history was changed because of these people.

00:59:51.380 --> 01:00:04.380
One of the things that they did is immediately the Jews, they sent diplomats to Rome and established diplomatic relations with Rome.

01:00:04.380 --> 01:00:13.380
Now, just let me point to you what happened in history because of this.

01:00:13.380 --> 01:00:20.380
The first time that the Greeks ever were defeated by anybody was by the Jews.

01:00:20.380 --> 01:00:27.880
And the Greeks became weakened both militarily and prestige-wise.

01:00:27.880 --> 01:00:35.620
Because all of a sudden, this is here, a bunch of peasants, you know, is able to defeat the Greeks.

01:00:35.620 --> 01:00:51.720
What happened afterwards, a few years after, come Pompey, the Romans, and they take over Egypt from the Greeks, and eventually they take over the whole Greek empire and becomes Roman.

01:00:51.720 --> 01:00:56.300
But this was possible because the Jews had weakened the Greeks.

01:00:57.080 --> 01:01:02.160
And therefore the Romans were able to come, conquer.

01:01:02.740 --> 01:01:07.640
And we know, of course, that at the end the Romans take over Israel also.

01:01:08.340 --> 01:01:13.840
And I don't want to go into the other part of the story because it's still suffering.

01:01:14.820 --> 01:01:20.580
Unfortunately, we did not rebuild the Beit Shadishi, although we had the opportunity to do that.

01:01:21.720 --> 01:01:23.200
So that's more or less the story.

01:01:23.660 --> 01:01:26.640
Now, what does it tell me, the story?

01:01:26.740 --> 01:01:32.900
What does it mean to me as a person living in what I call the postmodern period?

01:01:32.900 --> 01:01:37.560
We are living already, whether we like it or not, we're no longer modernity is passé.

01:01:37.940 --> 01:01:42.780
We're living already in a postmodern society in which we have total communication

01:01:42.780 --> 01:01:49.640
and we have practically solved the major problems, hunger, transportation.

01:01:49.640 --> 01:01:52.500
We are about to solve energy.

01:01:52.500 --> 01:01:57.300
Commerce is going to become soon, it's going to become only international.

01:01:57.300 --> 01:01:59.800
There's no longer going to be national commerce and so on.

01:01:59.800 --> 01:02:07.140
You have now with the GATT, you know, total open economic borders.

01:02:07.140 --> 01:02:10.640
So we are living really in a postmodern world.

01:02:10.640 --> 01:02:14.140
So what does it mean this to us?

01:02:14.140 --> 01:02:16.640
It means the following.

01:02:16.640 --> 01:02:22.800
There is a conflict, and one conflict that has been since the Jews appeared in history.

01:02:23.680 --> 01:02:24.980
The conflict is the following.

01:02:25.920 --> 01:02:29.560
We need laws to govern ourselves.

01:02:30.920 --> 01:02:32.180
We need order.

01:02:33.120 --> 01:02:35.580
What will be, what are the sources of this order?

01:02:36.800 --> 01:02:38.240
Where do we get order from?

01:02:39.560 --> 01:02:41.900
The Goy had a simple answer.

01:02:41.900 --> 01:02:45.220
The answer of the Goy always had been

01:02:45.220 --> 01:02:46.900
Might is right

01:02:46.900 --> 01:02:48.320
I am the king

01:02:48.320 --> 01:02:49.860
I hold the power

01:02:49.860 --> 01:02:52.580
And therefore you do what I want you to do

01:02:52.580 --> 01:02:53.380
Or else

01:02:53.380 --> 01:02:55.840
And

01:02:55.840 --> 01:02:58.920
The individual as such

01:02:58.920 --> 01:02:59.780
Has no rights

01:02:59.780 --> 01:03:02.440
He has no rights

01:03:02.440 --> 01:03:03.700
And therefore

01:03:03.700 --> 01:03:06.980
Ultimately it depends on what I

01:03:06.980 --> 01:03:08.200
The ruler, the sovereign

01:03:08.200 --> 01:03:10.460
Think is best for me

01:03:10.460 --> 01:03:15.460
And that is my main concern. The concern of the people is secondary, is marginal.

01:03:15.460 --> 01:03:21.460
And again, I have the power and I do it. You don't like it. You want to suffer the consequences.

01:03:21.460 --> 01:03:24.460
Why you want to suffer the consequences? Because I have the power. What does it mean I have power?

01:03:24.460 --> 01:03:31.460
I have power means I have the means to make you suffer the consequences of rebellion against my edicts or my wish.

01:03:31.460 --> 01:03:38.460
That is the system of government which was since the beginning of history till today.

01:03:38.460 --> 01:03:42.460
What does Judaism says? Judaism is a simple idea.

01:03:42.460 --> 01:03:46.460
There is such a thing as a Torah. What does it mean, Torah?

01:03:46.460 --> 01:03:51.460
Torah means that there are laws which are not depending on the government.

01:03:51.460 --> 01:03:57.460
Might is not right, but the other way around. Right is might.

01:03:57.460 --> 01:04:04.460
There is a law. And everybody is equal in front of this law.

01:04:04.460 --> 01:04:10.980
No matter whether you're a king, you're a shepherd, you're a peasant, you're equal.

01:04:11.880 --> 01:04:18.820
And therefore, the king, whether his name is Antiochus, or Napoleon, or Alexander,

01:04:19.840 --> 01:04:25.960
he has no authority to interfere in your life.

01:04:26.520 --> 01:04:30.960
That you, as an individual, you are protected by a law that cannot be manipulated

01:04:30.960 --> 01:04:34.800
by any office or by any human being.

01:04:35.820 --> 01:04:38.100
Even by your own government.

01:04:38.880 --> 01:04:39.980
Even when your Kohanim,

01:04:41.500 --> 01:04:43.960
like in the case of the Jews in Hanukkah,

