01:10:09.540 --> 01:10:13.540
Because those are issues that we are still struggling with.

01:10:13.540 --> 01:10:20.540
And we have the issue of cultural assimilation.

01:10:20.540 --> 01:10:26.540
Well, in a sense, we have become something like the Greek world.

01:10:26.540 --> 01:10:29.540
Like the Jew who assimilated in the Hellenistic world.

