01:16:26.500 --> 01:16:30.100
And there's a limit, a simple limit, you know.

01:16:30.100 --> 01:16:41.300
I mean, today we have to submit our children to homosexual ideology in schools.

01:16:42.680 --> 01:16:52.200
I mean, as your child, by virtue of going to a Gentile school, he's submitted to, this is what he's taught,

