01:19:33.120 --> 01:19:37.120
Is it possible to remove it?

01:19:37.120 --> 01:19:39.120
Will I do anything?

01:19:39.120 --> 01:19:43.120
And of course we say, no, I am one single person.

01:19:43.120 --> 01:19:47.120
I'm one single person. I cannot do it. There's nothing I can do. I'm impotent.

01:19:47.120 --> 01:19:50.120
Yes? I'm nothing.

